# AI Agent Ignore File — Prevents AI assistants from scanning or reading sensitive data, binaries, or large build artifacts

# 1. CRITICAL SECURITY — Secrets & Private Keys
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.template
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/secrets.yml
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.json
**/credentials.yml
**/credentials.yaml
**/credentials.json

# 2. Build Outputs & Artifacts
**/target/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/*.jar
**/*.war
**/*.class
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.so
**/*.dylib

# 3. Dependencies & Package Stores
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.gradle/
**/.m2/repository/

# 4. Storage, Logs & DB Dumps
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/storage/
**/uploads/
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db

# 5. IDE & OS Noise
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/settings.json
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
